    "detailed_description": "EVOREVO, the stage of this RPG that rebuilt the Earth's ecosystem that collapsed due to human tyranny.<br>Here, humans are at the bottom of the food chain, but for some reason, constant fighting continues just like the Earth.<br>You'll become Rope, 'a mixed-race boy who is both human and rabbit' and think about the problem of this planet where evolved animals are at odds with each other.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>This game can cause a change in your thinking about discrimination and coexistence</strong><br></li><li>a unique worldview that breaks prejudices against fantasy<br></li><li>Each character has its own unique skills<br></li><li>Satirical humor hidden around the game<br></li><li>Retro-style art<br></li><li>A strange ecosystem that is somewhat different from Earth<br></li><li>Various animals and various villages they built<br></li><li>There is a descendant of a locust called a 'Fairy' in EVOREVO</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "EVOREVO, the stage of this RPG that rebuilt the Earth's ecosystem that collapsed due to human tyranny.<br>Here, humans are at the bottom of the food chain, but for some reason, constant fighting continues just like the Earth.<br>You'll become Rope, 'a mixed-race boy who is both human and rabbit' and think about the problem of this planet where evolved animals are at odds with each other.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>This game can cause a change in your thinking about discrimination and coexistence</strong><br></li><li>a unique worldview that breaks prejudices against fantasy<br></li><li>Each character has its own unique skills<br></li><li>Satirical humor hidden around the game<br></li><li>Retro-style art<br></li><li>A strange ecosystem that is somewhat different from Earth<br></li><li>Various animals and various villages they built<br></li><li>There is a descendant of a locust called a 'Fairy' in EVOREVO</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Biodiversity breeds beauty and conflict. On Earth, on the next planet. This is a story of longing and deep thinking for coexistence. and the planet on which this story unfolds... RPG against discrimination, EVOREVO.",
